{"id":"v545kvclb8eyghmk6quhtx5qb","title":"古代文献常用（今人费解）词语（157）：百日红","originalTitle":null,"summary":"\"百日红\"是古代文献中紫薇的雅称，因花期长达百日而得名，寓含长久不衰之意。宋代杨万里已有以\"百日红\"咏紫薇的经典诗句。明代李时珍和清代陈淏子的著作中也收录此名。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=1251036&do=blog&id=1561098"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-14T00:08:29.700Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-14T00:08:29.700Z","category":null,"tags":["研究成果"],"score":21,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}